      { "reader": "Bryn", "kind": "described", "words": "Formal Garden" },
      { "reader": "Bryn", "kind": "described", "words": "This is the middle part of a formal garden. Hedges hide the cavern walls and a dim illumination comes from mosses far above. The path is of small crushed white stones. It winds among bushes and flower beds from south to north. To the north a small structure can be seen. To the south are peculiarly shaped bushes. There is a small gap in the hedges to the west." },
